# Earthcraft: "Tap an untapped creature you control: Untap target basic land." Llanowar Elves, cast this turn and so
# summoning sick, are tapped as the cost (it is Earthcraft's ability, not the Elves' own {T}, CR 302.6), and the tapped
# Forest untaps.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Llanowar Elves
Earthcraft
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
